									</div>

	</div>

    
    
    <div class="intro"></div>

    <div class="article-body">
        <p class="p3">Join us at St Mary Abbots Church on Kensington Church Street to mark the beginning of the festive period. Featuring the Opera Holland Park Chorus and principal singers from our 2027 Season, the evening will be filled with carols, seasonal music and good cheer.</p>
<p class="p3">This year also marks a special first, as the OHP Youth Chorus make their Christmas debut following their wonderful performance in our 2026 production of <i>Turandot</i>.</p>
<p class="p3">All tickets include a festive post-show drink, giving you the chance to raise a glass with the cast and company and celebrate the beginning of the Christmas season together.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div class="video-embed"><div class="embed-container"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dB-yqaQPVXU?feature=oembed&#038;enablejsapi=1&#038;showinfo=0&#038;loop=0&#038;autoplay=0&#038;controls=1&#038;rel=0&#038;html5=1" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen> frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div>

    </div>

    


        
    
    
</div>


            
<div class="article-sidebar" role="complementary">

    

            
    
    
    
            <div class="info-block">
        <div class="block-content">
            
            <div class="additional-info">
                Approximate running time: 1 hour and 30 minutes, followed by a festive post-show drink.
            </div>
            
        </div>
    </div>
    
        
